 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Ix: a zero-knowledge proof-carrying code platform",
  "excerpt": "The Ix platform enables the compilation of [Lean 4](https://github.com/leanprover/lean4) programs into zero-knowledge succinct non-interactive arguments of knowledge (zk-SNARKs). This allows the execution and typechecking of any Lean program to be verified by performing a sub-100-millisecond operation against an approximately 1 kilobyte certificate, regardless of the size of the original Lean program."
 },
